###Block: Banner Feats
Banner of Crowns	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Morale	PRESTAT:1,CHA=21	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.GreaterBanner	DESC:All morale bonuses granted by your banner increase by 1.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.92
Banner of the Golden Sun	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Morale	PRESTAT:1,CHA=21	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.GreaterBanner	DESC:Banner provides allies within 60 ft a +2 morale bonus to AC and Reflex saves.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.92
Banner of the Red Path	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Morale	PRESTAT:1,CHA=21	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.GreaterBanner	DESC:Banner provides allies within 60 ft a +2 bonus on attack and damage rolls.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.92
Banner of the White Blossom	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Morale	PRESTAT:1,CHA=21	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.GreaterBanner	DESC:Banner provides allies within 60 ft 2 temporary HP per hit die per day.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.92

###Block: Bond Feats
Boundless Bond	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Morale	PRESTAT:1,CHA=23	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.DivineBond	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Holy Champion	DESC:Enhancement bonus from Divine Bond +2. Can exceed +5.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.92
