###Block: Bardic Performance Feats
Deafening Song	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Morale	PRESKILL:1,Perform=21	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Bardic Performance	DESC:Temporarily deafen all enemies within 30-ft burst. Fort save DC 10+1/2 HD+Cha modifier.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.92
Hindering Song	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Morale	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Deafening Song	PRESKILL:1,Perform=24	DESC:Hinder enemy spellcasters within 30 ft. Concentration check vs your Performance check.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.93
Epic Inspiration	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Morale	PRESTAT:1,CHA=25	PRESKILL:1,Perform=27	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Bardic Performance	DESC:All competence, dodge, morale bonuses and bonus HD from Bardic Performance increase by +1.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.92
Group Inspiration	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Morale	PRESKILL:1,Perform=27	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Bardic Performance	DESC:Number of allies affected by inspire competence or inspire greatness doubles.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.92
Improved Aura of Courage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Morale	PRESTAT:1,CHA=25	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Aura of Courage	DESC:Aura of courage grants +8 morale bonus on saving throws against fear effects.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.93
Inspire Excellence	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Morale	PRESKILL:1,Perform=30	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Bardic Performance	DESC:Grant +4 competence bonus to one ability score of one ally during bardic performance.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.93
Lasting Inspiration	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Morale	PRESKILL:1,Perform=22	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Bardic Performance	DESC:Effects of inspire courage/competence/dirge of doom/frightening tune/inspire heroics last for 10 rounds after performance ends.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.93
Music of the Gods	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Morale	PRESTAT:1,CHA=25	PRESKILL:1,Perform=27	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Bardic Performance	DESC:Bardic performances affect creatures normally immune to mind-affecting effects. +8 bonus on Will saves to resist.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.93
Ranged Inspiration	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Morale	PRESKILL:1,Perform=21	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Bardic Performance	DESC:Double the range of any bardic performance that has a range.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.93
Rapid Inspiration	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Morale	PRESKILL:1,Perform=21	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Bardic Performance	DESC:Begin bardic performances as a free action.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.93
Reactive Countersong	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Morale	PREABILITY:2,CATEGORY=FEAT,Combat Reflexes,Rapid Inspiration	PRESKILL:1,Perform=27	DESC:Begin a countersong at any time, even when it is not your turn.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.93
